{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-primark-disney-101-dalmatians-zip-purse-2609-0014","content_id":"01ee8ec6-8db5-41f5-ba33-b0d16b9ed59d","description":"Product Recall for Primark Disney 101 Dalmatians Zip Purse presenting a serious chemical risk.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"4af7a20e-f46b-47f0-bb67-2e75d29ef018","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-09-04T15:58:14+01:00","id":"4af7a20e-f46b-47f0-bb67-2e75d29ef018","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-09-04T15:58:14+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a9adc855a0c25165ae46975/2609-0014-product-recall-primark-disney-101-dalmatians-zip-purse.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Primark Disney 101 Dalmatians Zip Purse</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious chemical risk as it contains excess concentrations of phthalates.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by Primark.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Clothing, textiles, and fashion items - Wallets/Purses/Travel Document Holders</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Primark</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Code</td>\n      <td>991174725</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Kimball Number</td>\n      <td>2595301</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sales Period</td>\n      <td>March 2026 – June 2026</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Faux leather coin purse with a dalmatian design.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_4af7a20e-f46b-47f0-bb67-2e75d29ef018\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a9adc855a0c25165ae46975/2609-0014-product-recall-primark-disney-101-dalmatians-zip-purse.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious chemical risk because it contains phthalates above permitted levels. Phthalates may harm the health of children, possibly causing damage to the reproductive system.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the REACH Enforcement Regulations 2008 or the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by Primark.</p>\n\n<p>Owners should stop using the product immediately and keep it away from children. For more information, please access the Primark website at: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.primark.com/help/s/article/Product-safety-recall---101-Dalmatians-Faux-Leather-Coin-Purse?language=en_GB\">Product safety recall - 101 Dalmatians Faux Leather Coin Purse</a> or contact <a href=\"mailto:help.uk@help.primark.com\">help.uk@help.primark.com</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2609-0014</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-09-04T14:59:43Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"clothing-textiles-fashion","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-09-04","product_risk_level":"serious"}